Author: Michael Krog <mic@apaq.dk>
Date:   Fri Sep 25 11:51:20 2026 +0200

    feat(java): pathland-qt-demo JNA host (Phase D)

    - New lib/java/pathland-qt-demo module: QtHost mirrors GtkHost — mounts the
      shared SplitNavDemo (incl. native navigation) via RingOpcodeSink, pumps the
      same libpathland_core ring in place through pathland_qt_run_ring, drains EVENT
      opcodes and dispatches into the app's bindings. QtRendererNative is the JNA
      binding to libpathland_qt (pathland.qt.lib). RingEventReader + headless
      RingEventReaderTest mirror the GTK demo's.
    - scripts/run-java-qt-demo.sh + lib.sh build_qt_dylibs; module added to the
      Java reactor (headless tests only, no Qt needed on CI).
    - renderer: defer FILL (anchors) until a widget gains its final parent and skip
      positioners (Row/Column/Grid reject anchors) — removes the FILL-in-Row
      warning for the common stack pattern; placeDestination/promote guarded.
    - status.md + AGENTS.md updated.

    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M3BZM077YCT3CG7CQ6ZGGGTJ

